### This file contains HTTP requests to test your API
### You can use the REST Client extension in VS Code to run these

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts

###

### Get a single post (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts/YOUR_POST_ID_HERE

###

### Create a new post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post"
}

###

### Create another post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Understanding REST APIs"
}

###

### Update a post (PUT - full update) - replace with actual ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/posts/YOUR_POST_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Blog Post Title"
}

###

### Partial update (PATCH) - replace with actual ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/posts/YOUR_POST_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Partially Updated Title"
}

###

### Delete a post - replace with actual ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/posts/6909cfa3bc49ff489d294c6c

###
